    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ClaimShield AI - main workflow (orchestrator)\n1. **Claim Form**: the web page where a claim is declared (open it with the form URL).\n2. **Validate Claim**: policy and required fields (agent 04, stage validate). Invalid claims are rejected before any AI call.\n3. **Agents**: Visual Inspection (photos) → Invoice Parser (PDF) → Policy RAG (coverage) → Incident Plausibility (story vs map, weather, invoice).\n4. **Decide**: agent 04, stage decide: risk score and route.\n5. **Route**: one action per route, then the claim is saved in Airtable and the result page is shown.\n\nAn agent that fails does not stop the claim: it is sent to human review.",
        "height": 330,
        "width": 560,
        "color": 5
      },
